[Refutes "1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d5 3. exd5 e4 4. d3"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d5 3. exd5 e4 4. d3? { White tries to attack the e4 pawn but forgets that its knight is still attacked. } 4... exf3 { Takes the knight for free. } 5. Qxf3 5... Nf6 6. Nc3 6... Bb4 *
